"}, {"file_name": "store-04-source-assembly.png", "id": "1548633643226364", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824318_1548633646559697_7297799975838773294_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BPhx_POx3KIQ7kNvwEcJSXO&_nc_oc=AdqE2owFL2Vy04Ellc-DTRMMMzvLlfO9nWvvfnH-pTlmHefN4TKxj52XKXRF5nKuHXs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJwea3whHoMJrCZ_vGzUktBKbp1KxEDcwPmb6wfE9LxDg&oe=6AB3D420"}, {"file_name": "store-03-blue-hologram.png", "id": "1160826089604529", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825563_1160826092937862_5729086189951941997_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AqFW-tGceFgQ7kNvwG72ur5&_nc_oc=Adr22atnFS9qK2pZmaY7s6SFKqEn3jRxmOh_p8cqc3blTS5ZMcjMqn6uAPzND5DAsWw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIkKUVNXCQv7vjFsCaCW7_jR7sHKU_hod55li4qhYb0jw&oe=6AB3DDA2"}, {"file_name": "store-06-source-joints.png", "id": "1613021433699869", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823746_1613021437033202_467147905405238580_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9z5YBrFIkKYQ7kNvwEBerM9&_nc_oc=AdrInfJl_SsKb04cmGur5AoLvSiML-LXSN11n4Y6rA0pzo7nI4e5pSf3x49t746og9c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJTIrKlkB1Gp-V1vMRV5uiAgLXF3Le8b_zNXltBSt9kzA&oe=6AB3CC41"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "trailer-cover.png", "id": "2160832664821064", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824665_2160832668154397_1522314912689723401_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=B-4VrLODB7UQ7kNvwFdLFSs&_nc_oc=Adqz_b6V33tYvr0QwqBchUi5Uyw6hDZPdGTgwwbmXFxyYCBvp2PF9835gKcDqoNzmWg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJvsjtJ8wzEZv-jSS-ISF0Xm6Kas3jEQZsqF50f5Tt_Og&oe=6AB3F292"}, "display_name": "RobotAtlas", "keywords": ["Robot", "3D", "Holo", "Humanoid", "Machines"], "long_description": "Explore published robot models in 3D.\n\nRobot Atlas is an independent visualization app by Nebulytic for Meta Quest 3. Browse 71 models grouped by source company, then inspect one on a movable glass base. Resize the rack, toolbar and model to suit your space.\n\nChoose passthrough, Studio or Black. Switch between full source colour, colour hologram, blue hologram, see-through and exploded assembly views. Exploded view separates only the parts actually included in a source; it does not reveal missing geometry.\n\n70 models use exterior or simplified simulation geometry. ODRI Bolt contains a partial engineering assembly, without complete wiring, battery, camera or factory documentation. Detailed internal systems are generally absent. Published units and materials are source data, not certified real-world dimensions or finishes.\n\nThe UR5e supports six verified source-defined joints for kinematic inspection. Import your own self-contained static GLB files (up to 64 MiB and 250,000 triangles). Imports remain on your headset; skinned, animated and compressed models are unsupported.\n\nYou purchase the viewer software. Third-party models remain under their original licences, with credits in the app. Source names identify the robots; no manufacturer endorsement is implied. Internet is needed for uncached collection models.\n", "short_description": "View 71 published robot models in mixed reality or a virtual room. Rotate, resize, change visual style and separate source parts. Import your own static GLB files. Most included sources show exterior or simplified simulation geometry; detailed internals are generally absent.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://nebulytic.com/apps/robot-atlas/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://nebulytic.com/apps/robot-atlas/terms", "publisher_name": "Nebulytic", "support_website_url": "https://nebulytic.com/apps/robot-atlas/support", "website_url": "https://nebulytic.com/apps/robot-atlas/", "category": null, "comfort_rating"